WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.877
Let's play a part instead of entering steps. C selects track three. Hold Menu and press pad sixteen, then choose Synth with pad fifteen.

2
00:00:07.944 --> 00:00:14.079
Shift and Main opens Play. Try pads one, three, and five. Keep it short enough to remember.

3
00:00:14.079 --> 00:00:18.322
Press Record. Watch the count-in, and let the first bar settle before you play.

4
00:00:18.322 --> 00:00:25.059
Play that little phrase on one, three, and five. Press Record again to finish the take and turn it into a clip.

5
00:00:25.059 --> 00:00:29.941
Press Overdub and add pad seven. Press Overdub again when you've added enough.

6
00:00:29.941 --> 00:00:35.301
Stop, then Sixteen Level shows what you played. If a take doesn't work, Undo gives you another go.
